@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #303030
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #303030
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #303030
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #505050
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderThickness 1.8
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #666666
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F4F4F4
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #202020
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber

title 图2-6 清除本机行程记录用例顺序图

actor "旅客" as Traveller
boundary "行程页面\n<<boundary>>" as Page
control "本机行程管理\n<<control>>" as LocalJourney
entity "当前设备保存的行程信息\n<<entity>>" as LocalRecord

Traveller -> Page : 选择清除本机行程记录
activate Page
Page -> LocalJourney : 请求清除本机记录
activate LocalJourney

alt 正在提交创建信息
    LocalJourney --> Page : 暂不允许清除
    Page --> Traveller : 等待提交结束后再操作
else 可以清除记录
    LocalJourney -> LocalRecord : 清除行程编号、创建时填写的信息及记录
    activate LocalRecord
    alt 清除成功
        LocalRecord --> LocalJourney : 记录已清除
    else 当前设备无法清除保存内容
        LocalRecord --> LocalJourney : 保存内容未能清除
        LocalJourney --> Page : 告知本机记录未清除的情况
        Page --> Traveller : 说明再次打开时可能仍读到原记录
    end
    deactivate LocalRecord

    LocalJourney -> LocalJourney : 停止原行程后续展示
    LocalJourney -> LocalJourney : 清空当前内容和较早保留的结果
    LocalJourney --> Page : 复位本次行程展示
    Page -> Page : 清空填写内容及原行程提示
    Page --> Traveller : 返回创建行程页面
    deactivate Page
end
deactivate LocalJourney

note over Page, LocalRecord
正常清除后，再次进入不自动恢复该行程。
本操作只影响当前设备保存的信息，
不等同于删除系统中的全部行程。
end note
@enduml
